# Plan — <feature>

> **Standard lane**: discovery and spec on one page, approved in a single step.
> Written by the **leader** from real exploration of this codebase — not from
> the title alone. Keep it short: a reader should approve it in two minutes.
> Write this document in English.

## Request

What is being asked, in one or two sentences.

## Findings

What the code actually shows: the relevant files, existing patterns to reuse,
and constraints. Cite real paths (e.g. `src/...`).

## Approach

What changes where, in a few bullets. One alternative considered and why it
lost, in one line.

